From: Deividas Nastajus <16858119+dns54@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 13:11:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 24/25] LvglPkg/LvglDisplayEngineDxe: Show dialog messages above the
 buttons

CreateDialogShell() adds the title, a separator and the button row to
the dialog card, and the callers add the message afterwards, so every
dialog showed its buttons above the text. This affects HII popups such
as Secure Boot's "Configuration changed" notice and the F10 save
prompt.

Move the message label to just after the separator.

Signed-off-by: Deividas Nastajus <16858119+dns54@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 LvglDisplayEngineDxe/LvglFormRenderer.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/LvglPkg/LvglDisplayEngineDxe/LvglFormRenderer.c b/LvglPkg/LvglDisplayEngineDxe/LvglFormRenderer.c
index 189b477..b61a2e3 100644
--- a/LvglPkg/LvglDisplayEngineDxe/LvglFormRenderer.c
+++ b/LvglPkg/LvglDisplayEngineDxe/LvglFormRenderer.c
@@ -881,6 +881,8 @@ CreateDialogMessageLabel (
   }
 
   lv_label_set_text (MsgLbl, Text);
+  // After the shell's title and separator, before its button row
+  lv_obj_move_to_index (MsgLbl, 2);
   lv_obj_set_style_text_color (MsgLbl, lv_color_hex (THEME_COLOR_TEXT_POPUP), 0);
   THEME_APPLY_BODY_FONT (MsgLbl);
   return MsgLbl;
